DESCRIPTION:Easily Digestible. Politically charged. Even tempered. None of 
 these words would ever describe the comedic stylings of Philadelphia’s ow
 n\, Ryan Shaner.\n\nFrom off the wall takes on everything he sees fit to ma
 ke light of or tear down to wild stories of his childhood and day to day ex
 periences\, nothing seems to be out of range for him to take a shot at. You
  won’t leave with a “message” or have learned a “lesson” watching
  him but you will leave satisfied knowing that nonsense is more relatable t
 han you ever gave it credit for. Take your hand off the wheel for a moment 
 and let him hazardously steer you head on into laughter.\n\nFrom Netflix’
 s Tires\; The End: with Ryan Shaner\; World War Fun\; Solomon\n\nThere is a
